-- Generated by apps/dbc-tools/generate.py, hand-extracted from its full output per this repo's
-- standing practice (every run also reproduces a large pre-existing unrelated diff - ~613 spells
-- this time - that must not be folded into an unrelated migration).
--
-- Two content gaps found via live playtest, both now closed:
--
-- 1. Capstone effects should never be a surprise at max rank - every capstone-bearing Frost talent
--    now previews its capstone line (in muted |cFF9D9D9D grey|r, matching the tooltip idiom
--    Blizzard's own DBC data already uses for conditional text) at every rank below max, turning
--    plain/active at max rank. Two talents (Permafrost 11175/12569/12571, Improved Cone of Cold
--    11190/12489/12490) were missing their capstone text *and* part of their base-effect text
--    entirely - fixed alongside the preview. Full per-talent list: Frostbite, Frost Warding,
--    Permafrost, Frost Channeling, Arctic Reach, Ice Shards, Improved Cone of Cold, Shattered
--    Barrier, Frozen Core, Arctic Winds, Enduring Winter, Chilled to the Bone (13 total; Biting
--    Cold already had this exact preview pattern and needed no change; Winter's Chill has no
--    capstone bonus per docs/frost-mage-redesign.md and is untouched).
-- 2. Icicles (200001) was missing `CumulativeAura` (=5) - the notes column in mage.csv already
--    claimed "stacking (CumulativeAura=5)" but the key was never actually added to raw_overrides,
--    so it silently generated as the default (no stack cap). Added.
--
-- Source of truth: apps/dbc-tools/source/{spells,talents}/*. Regenerate with:
-- python3 apps/dbc-tools/generate.py

